  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil a full kettle. Pour boiled water into a large saucepan over a high heat with a pinch of salt.\n• Add fusilli to boiling water and cook until ‘al dente’, 11 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people), then drain and return fusilli to the saucepan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking. TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e6a1ecf7dc65580b216e/step-d48df030.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Roughly chop green olives.\n• Roughly chop silverbeet.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e6a1ecf7dc65580b216e/step-0442aa41.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook soffritto mix, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes. Add garlic and dried oregano and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 2 minutes.\n• Add passata, brown sugar, vegetable stock powder and reserved pasta water. Simmer until thickened slightly, 2-3 minutes. Stir through olives, silverbeet and red pesto and cook, until silverbeet has wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat. Add butter and cooked fusilli. Toss to coat, then season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e6a1ecf7dc65580b216e/step-f24cb6ac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mediterranean tomato and oregano fusilli between bowls. Crumble fetta cubes on top.\n• Serve sprinkled with flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6100e6a1ecf7dc65580b216e/step-b2d980a4.jpg"
    }
  ]
